WEBVTT

00:16:59.996 --> 00:17:04.996
We've got the tools, the knowledge and the cash,

00:17:04.996 --> 00:17:08.996
and commitment to preventing HIV too.

00:17:08.996 --> 00:17:14.996
Ines: So why is prevalence still rising?

00:17:14.996 --> 00:17:17.996
It's all politics.

00:17:17.996 --> 00:17:20.996
When you get to politics, nothing makes sense.

00:17:20.996 --> 00:17:23.996
Elizabeth Pisani: "When you get to politics, nothing makes sense."

00:17:23.996 --> 00:17:26.996
So, from the point of view of a sex worker,

00:17:26.996 --> 00:17:28.996
politicians are making no sense.

00:17:28.996 --> 00:17:30.996
From the point of view of a public health nerd,